OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Frain, heavy at times, becoming clear
OL,7,Fand dry, but strong winds persist,
OL,8,Freaching gale force in places. Clear
OL,9,Fspells will be short-lived as showers
OL,10,Fsoon move in, some will be heavy at
OL,11,Ftimes.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FHeavy and blustery showers
OL,14,Fcontinue, with strong winds reaching
OL,15,Fgale force in places, some sunny
OL,16,Fspells in-between showers. Showers
OL,17,Fease somewhat by the evening, but
OL,18,Fwinds remain strong.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
